\small
\begin{tabular}{llll}
\hline
Action & $\Delta\phi$/step (Eq.\,\ref{eq:offset_state}) & Blocked party & Repayable? \\
\hline
\texttt{GE} & $+1$ (extends cycle) & Side green pushed back & Only with headroom \\
\texttt{INS} & $+1$ (extends cycle) & Whatever phase is carved & Only with headroom \\
\texttt{ER} & $-1$ (shortens cycle) & Nobody (bus cleared) & Yes (gives time back) \\
